Z||000000||overlord||10-11-2000||08:53 AM||||Is the headlight  switch and dimmer supposed to be backlight? the defrost and deck lid release switches are lit. Now since you turn on your headlights when its dark, wouldnt it make sense to have the switch light up so u cann see it??? i took  out that switch but can see no bulbs of any kind..............anyone??||||reg||1
